{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart. You'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and weapon mods to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, fins, gliders, and distributing weight evenly to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be helped along the way by a massive assortment of perks and upgrades that allow you to adapt to any situation within the<strong>\u00a0Appendix</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development of <i>Nanima</i> progresses I plan to continue adding weapons, effects, perks, game modes, bosses, music, and refine gameplay overall based on feedback. So stay tuned and try out the demo, there's a lot planned!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395890?t=1768484018","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3395890?t=1768484018","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/1d6052156186eb9a2902ed149c7a9c9dc704d6c9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768484018","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/1d6052156186eb9a2902ed149c7a9c9dc704d6c9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768484018","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4245540,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through a constantly evolving microscopic world to deliver a vital payload. The inhabitants of the microcosm may be small but they can tear you apart. You'll have to scavenge what's left of previous expeditions to bolster your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine dozens of unique weapons and weapon mods to create devastating combos while strategically placing thrusters, fins, gliders, and distributing weight evenly to fine-tune your movement and outmaneuver enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll be helped along the way by a massive assortment of perks and upgrades that allow you to adapt to any situation within the<strong>\u00a0Appendix</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As development of <i>Nanima</i> progresses I plan to continue adding weapons, effects, perks, game modes, bosses, music, and refine gameplay overall based on feedback. So stay tuned and try out the demo, there's a lot planned!</p>","developers":["Precism"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395890/94b0383e8aed84ab8fb1044e56b887efc66ac800/header.jpg?t=1768484018","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Nanima \u00a9 2025 Precism Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3395890/915753188/5bac17b077a8bdbf2b0408de141ac5e555a43a6e/1765422076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765422683","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3395890/915753188/5bac17b077a8bdbf2b0408de141ac5e555a43a6e/1765422076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765422683","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3395890/915753188/5bac17b077a8bdbf2b0408de141ac5e555a43a6e/1765422076/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765422683","id":257247054,"name":"Nanima Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257247054/d78431a2159580fd287d3e0ddc5b4c976af7f852/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765422683"}],"name":"Nanima","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"b